+## Local adaptation (this box: review output contract)
+
+Findings go to `$AGENT_TMP/review.md` (per-agent temp root, see
+`/tmp-agent-skill` — never the `/tmp` root), sorted by severity: Critical,
+High, Medium, Low. Explain only the most severe issues in depth; keep the
+rest one-line. Close with a `N/4` score (`1/4 bad`, `2/4 almost ready
+production`, `3/4 ready for prod with minor`, `4/4 perfect`) plus residual
+risk and test gaps. If no real issues, say so clearly. Review like a merge
+gate: real issues, not style noise.
